license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - agent skills
  - Claude Code
  - SKILL.md
  - LLM evaluation
  - benchmark
abstract: >-
  Static health checks of public agent skills (SKILL.md packages) pinned to
  exact Git commits, and controlled with/without-skill benchmarks run in
  Claude Code headless mode, with Wilson and Newcombe 95% intervals.
  Methodology: https://skillflux.app/methodology/v1/
